This list is CONTEXTUAL ONLY.

The presence of a familiar institutional category does not prove that the actor occupies any particular R-I-T role in the supplied document.

GREEN-TRANSITION REGULATORY FUNCTIONS

EU green governance often relies on information-intensive and conformity-based regulatory mechanisms.

